msgid "Last Updated on"
msgstr ""

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__new_variant_count
msgid "New Variants"
msgstr "新增变体数"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/static/src/js/variant_conversion_dialog.js:0
msgid "New variant (created by the conversion)"
msgstr "新建变体（由本次转换创建）"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:product_variant_conversion.product_variant_conversion_action
msgid "No variant conversion recorded yet"
msgstr "还没有转换记录"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_product__variant_conversion_count
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_template__variant_conversion_count
msgid "Number of conversions applied to this product."
msgstr "本产品经历的转换次数。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__new_variant_count
msgid ""
"Number of variants created by the conversion; every variant that existed "
"before is kept as is."
msgstr "本次转换新建的变体数；转换前的每条变体都原样保留。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__product_variant_count_before
msgid "Number of variants the product had before the conversion."
msgstr "转换前产品的变体数。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__product_variant_count_after
msgid "Number of variants the product had once the conversion was applied."
msgstr "转换后产品的变体数。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__lineage_ids
msgid ""
"One line per variant that took part in the conversion: which variant it was "
"before and which combination it carries now."
msgstr "每条参与转换的变体一行：转换前是哪条记录、转换后占哪个组合。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"One of the original variants of %(product)s disappeared during the "
"conversion; nothing has been changed."
msgstr "转换过程中 %(product)s 的某条原变体消失了，本次转换未做任何改动。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_lineage__is_kept
msgid "Original Record Kept"
msgstr "原记录保留"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_lineage__origin_variant_id
msgid "Original Variant"
msgstr "原变体"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_product__variant_origin_id
msgid ""
"Original variant this variant was created from during a conversion: the "
"record that kept the stock, the orders and the invoices. Empty for the "
"variants that existed before the conversion (they are the origins "
"themselves) and for manually created ones."
msgstr "该变体在转换中派生自哪条原变体，也就是当时保留库存、订单与发票的那条记录。转换前就存在的变体（它们本身就是来源）与手工新建的变体上为空。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model,name:product_variant_conversion.model_product_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_conversion__product_tmpl_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_lineage__product_tmpl_id
#: model:ir.module.category,name:base.module_category_inventory_product
msgid "Product"
msgstr "产品"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model,name:product_variant_conversion.model_product_product
msgid "Product Variant"
msgstr "产品变体"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model,name:product_variant_conversion.model_product_variant_lineage
msgid "Product Variant Lineage"
msgstr "产品变体谱系"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_lineage__result_variant_id
msgid "Resulting Variant"
msgstr "结果变体"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_variant_lineage__is_kept
msgid ""
"Set when the resulting variant is the very same product variant record as "
"the original one: no record was created nor deleted for this combination."
msgstr "当结果变体就是原来那条变体记录时置位：这个组合没有新建也没有删除任何记录。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_product__variant_conversion_mapping
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_conversion.field_product_template__variant_conversion_mapping
msgid ""
"Technical field used by the product form. When an attribute change creates "
"new variants, the form asks for the variant ownership and sends it here, "
"together with the attribute change itself. It is cleared as soon as the "
"conversion has been applied."
msgstr "产品表单使用的技术字段：属性变更会新增变体时，表单先问归属映射、再把归属与属性变更一起提交到这里；转换应用完即刻清空。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The form sent an ownership for variant %(variant)s, which is not a variant "
"of %(product)s."
msgstr "表单为变体 %(variant)s 指定了归属，但它不是 %(product)s 的变体。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid "The form sent unknown attribute values for variant %(variant)s."
msgstr "表单为变体 %(variant)s 提交了不存在的属性取值。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The original variant of %(product)s that should carry %(values)s does not; "
"nothing has been changed."
msgstr "%(product)s 中本应携带 %(values)s 的原变体没有带上该组合，本次转换未做任何改动。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The original variants %(first)s and %(second)s would both become %(values)s;"
" give every original variant its own combination."
msgstr "原变体 %(first)s 与 %(second)s 都被指定成了 %(values)s；请让每条原变体各占一个组合。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The product %(product)s creates variants on demand (a dynamic attribute is "
"configured), so its variants are handled by Odoo itself."
msgstr "产品 %(product)s 配置了按需生成的属性，其变体由 Odoo 按需创建，无需本向导。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The product %(product)s has %(count)s archived variants. Restore or delete "
"them first: the conversion works on the variants that are in use and must "
"not silently reactivate older ones."
msgstr "产品 %(product)s 有 %(count)s 条已归档变体。请先恢复或删除它们：转换只作用于在用的变体，不应悄悄把旧变体重新激活。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The product %(product)s has %(count)s variants instead of the expected "
"%(expected)s; nothing has been changed."
msgstr "产品 %(product)s 的变体数为 %(count)s，与预期 %(expected)s 不符，本次转换未做任何改动。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid "The product %(product)s has no variant to keep."
msgstr "产品 %(product)s 没有任何可保留的变体。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The values chosen for the original variant %(variant)s (%(values)s) are "
"excluded by the attribute configuration of this product; choose another "
"combination."
msgstr "为原变体 %(variant)s 指定的取值组合（%(values)s）被本产品的属性配置排除，请另选一个组合。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The variant ownership sent by the form could not be read. Reload the page "
"and save again."
msgstr "读不出表单提交的变体归属。请重新加载页面后再保存一次。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/static/src/xml/variant_conversion_dialog.xml:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change adds variants. Tell which existing variant keeps each "
"combination: the chosen variant record keeps its stock, its orders and its "
"invoices, and the other combinations are created as new variants."
msgstr "这次属性变更会新增变体。请指定每个组合由哪条既有变体继续承载：被选中的那条记录保留它的库存、订单与发票，其余组合作为新变体创建。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change creates new variants of %(product)s: every existing "
"variant has to be told which combination it keeps, so the save is held back "
"until the ownership is confirmed from the product form. Save again from the "
"form to get the dialog; if it does not show up, reload the page (Ctrl+F5) so"
" that the module's assets are up to date."
msgstr ""
"这次属性变更会为 %(product)s "
"新增变体：每条既有变体都要指定它保留哪个组合，所以在产品表单里确认归属之前不会保存。请在产品表单里再点一次保存以弹出确认框；如果没有弹出，请强刷页面（Ctrl+F5）让本模块的前端资源生效。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change removes values and would archive or delete %(count)s "
"existing variants of %(product)s, which carry their own stock, orders and "
"invoices. Nothing has been changed. Archive or delete those variants first "
"if you really want to drop them."
msgstr ""
"这次属性变更删掉了取值，会让 %(product)s 的 %(count)s "
"条既有变体（它们各自带着库存、订单与发票）被归档或删除。本次未做任何改动；确实要删这些变体，请先把它们归档或删除。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change removes values and would archive or delete %(count)s "
"existing variants, which carry their own stock, orders and invoices. Archive"
" or delete those variants first if you really want to drop them."
msgstr ""
"这次属性变更删掉了取值，会让 %(count)s 条既有变体（它们各自带着库存、订单与发票）被归档或删除。确实要删这些变体，请先把它们归档或删除。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change would leave %(expected)s variants out of the "
"%(existing)s variants of %(product)s: some of them would be archived or "
"deleted. Nothing has been changed. Archive or delete the variants you do not"
" need first."
msgstr ""
"这次属性变更会让 %(product)s 的 %(existing)s 条变体只剩 %(expected)s "
"条：其中一部分会被归档或删除。本次未做任何改动；不需要的变体请先自行归档或删除。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This attribute change would leave %(expected)s variants out of the "
"%(existing)s variants of this product: some of them would be archived or "
"deleted. Archive or delete the variants you do not need first."
msgstr ""
"这次属性变更会让本产品的 %(existing)s 条变体只剩 %(expected)s 条：其中一部分会被归档或删除。不需要的变体请先自行归档或删除。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This configuration would create %(count)s variants, above the limit of "
"%(limit)s set by the system parameter product.dynamic_variant_limit. Reduce "
"the number of values."
msgstr ""
"当前配置会生成 %(count)s 个变体，超过系统参数 product.dynamic_variant_limit 设定的上限 "
"%(limit)s，请减少取值。"

#. module: product_variant_conversion
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_variant_conversion/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"This configuration would keep only %(count)s variants out of the "
"%(existing)s variants of %(product)s: the attribute configuration of the "
"product excludes some combinations. Adjust the attribute values first."
msgstr ""
